hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2774","###\n Narrated to us by Yusuf bin Musa, who said: Narrated to us by Jarir, from Abu Ishaq (who is Al-Shaybani), from Ziyad bin 'Ilaqah, from Usamah bin Sharik, who said: \I went out with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) performing Hajj. People would come to him"," and some would say: 'O Messenger of Allah"," I performed Sa'i before Tawaf","' or 'I delayed something","' or 'I advanced something.' He would say to"""
